            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Vengeful Suffocation"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation, occult, necromancy)\n\nFrequency: 1/hour\n\nThe onryo channels their boundless resentment, manifesting it as a tangled clump of wet hair, a clot of rancid swamp mud, or other disgusting mass of matter in the throat of a creature within 30 feet. The creature must attempt a DC 32 Fortitude save.\n\nCritical Success: \nSuccess: \nFailure: \nCritical Failure: "
            },
